; NCREC RED4ext — optional render-only fullscreen preview
; Copy/rename this file to NCREC.ini in red4ext/plugins/NCREC/
; Requires Cyberpunk 2.50 and a game-compatible RED4ext loader.
;
; WARNING: This still hooks DirectX. Test only at the main menu or pause
; screen. The fullscreen preview is NOT INTERACTIVE.
; If no [Hotkeys] ToggleVK exists, first-run keyboard setup appears.
; Choose F6-F9, F11-F12, Insert, Home, End, PageUp or PageDown.
; Enter saves, Esc hides, F8 reopens. F10 is reserved for CET.
; Saved [Hotkeys] ToggleVK overrides ToggleKey below.
; Keypresses also reach the game: use setup at the main/pause menu.
; NCREC does not capture mouse/keyboard or pause the game.
; To recover, delete/rename NCREC.ini or set PassiveFullscreen=0.
[Experimental]
PassiveFullscreen=1
ToggleKey=F8
